			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dum matutinis praesudat solibus aër,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Rapt. Pros. 2, 120</span></i>
			.— —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to exert one's self
